  "published": "2026-10-15T14:59:37.87Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Changelog:\n\n- [#6292] CachedLayoutRendererWrapper - Support CachedUntil=HourChange and CachedUntil=DayChange. (@dualfroz)\n- [#6298] ObjectGraphScanner - Skip scanning Layout.Empty. (@snakefoot)\n- [#6297] Remove Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub as part of NET8 SDK. (@snakefoot)\n- [#6296] FileTarget - Refactor RollingArchiveFileHandler to reduce complexity. (@snakefoot)\n- [#6295] NullTarget - LastMessage property lock SyncRoot. (@snakefoot)\n- [#6303] XmlParser - Keep whitespace from character references in InnerText. (@APX403)\n- [#6289] MemoryTarget - Introduced DumpInitialError with focused diagnostic context. (@snakefoot)\n- [#6287] MemoryTarget - Introduced DumpOnError with full diagnostic context. (@snakefoot)\n- [#6283] MemoryTarget - RingBuffer supporting non-blocking enumeration. (@snakefoot)\n\nNLog v6.2 release notes: https://nlog-project.org/2026/08/16/nlog-6-2-aot-build-size.html\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/NLog/NLog/releases\n\nFor all config options and platform support, check https://nlog-project.org/config/",
